### Week 1: Foundation
- [ ] **Day 1-2:** Scope Contract 1.1 (Parallelize homepage fetches)
- [ ] **Day 3:** Scope Contract 1.2 (React.cache)
- [ ] **Day 4:** Scope Contract 1.3 (unstable_cache)

### Week 2: Bundle & Queries
- [ ] **Day 1-2:** Scope Contract 2.1 (Reduce client components)
- [ ] **Day 3:** Scope Contract 2.2 (Dynamic imports)
- [ ] **Day 4-5:** Scope Contract 3.1 (GROQ optimization)

### Week 3: Integration & Polish
- [ ] **Day 1-2:** Scope Contract 3.2 (VFS integration)
- [ ] **Day 3:** Scope Contract 4.1 (Image optimization)
- [ ] **Day 4-5:** Scope Contract 5.1 & 5.2 (Suspense, React.memo)

