## Risk Mitigation

| Risk | Mitigation |
|------|------------|
| Breaking changes in homepage | A/B test in staging, gradual rollout |
| Cache invalidation issues | Short TTL initially, monitoring alerts |
| VFS integration bugs | Comprehensive tests before deploy, fallback to legacy |
| Dynamic import issues | SSR-safe loading, fallback UI |
| GROQ query errors | Field-by-field migration, validation tests |

