## Regression Testing Protocol

### Overview
**MANDATORY:** Regression test suite MUST pass before AND after each scope contract deployment.

**Test File:** `tests/regression/run-regression-tests.cjs`
**Total Tests:** 27 (covering all at-risk areas)
**Execution Time:** ~40ms
**Pass Criteria:** 27/27 tests passing

### Test Coverage Matrix

| Test Suite | Tests | Risk Areas Covered |
|------------|-------|-------------------|
| VFS Data Integrity | 7 | slotMetadataMap, slug resolution, catalogue.ts exports |
| Homepage Components | 5 | 9 component files, 6 fetchers, async/SC verification |
| Product Pages | 5 | Promise.all usage, VFS integration, query exports |
| Client Components | 3 | Critical interactive components, "use client" directives |
| Sanity Client | 4 | sanityFetch export, CDN config, types file |
| Build Integrity | 3 | TS compilation, config files, package.json |

### Pre-Deployment Checklist (Per Scope Contract)

Before deploying ANY scope contract:

```bash
# 1. Run regression suite
node tests/regression/run-regression-tests.cjs

# 2. Verify 27/27 passing
# If any fail: FIX BEFORE PROCEEDING

# 3. Run VFS unit tests
node tests/unit/vfs/run-all-tests.ts

# 4. Verify 28/28 passing
```

