## Notes

- **Priority:** Phase 1 (Data Fetching) has highest impact, focus there first
- **Safety:** Each scope contract is isolated, can be deployed independently
- **Rollback:** All changes are additive or can be feature-flagged
- **Monitoring:** Add performance monitoring before changes to measure impact
